title: 2030
subtitle: A new year
tags: event
view-if: year = 2030 and month = 1
priority: 2
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1 if budget > 0

A new year begins. The government has promised to cut emissions by 65% compared to 1990 by 2030, and that deadline has now arrived. [? if economic_growth < 1 : Industry warns that it cannot afford the transition in a weak economy. ?][? if economic_growth >= 1 : The economy is growing again, which makes the climate targets easier to defend. ?]
